===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} [[noy]] (short for [[annoy]], from  ''[[annoien#Middle English|an(n)oien]]'', ''[[enoien#Middle English|enoien]]'' from {{etyl|xno}} ''[[anuier]]'', from {{etyl|fro}} ''[[enuier]]'' (French: ''[[ennuyer]]''), from {{etyl|LL.}} ''[[inodiare]]'' (to make hateful), from [[in-]] (intensive prefix) + [[odium]] (hate). <ref>[http://wordsmith.org/words/noisome.html Wordsmith's entry for noisome]</ref>

